tion deployment.</p><button class="btn btn-neon">Save Settings</button></form></div><div class="dashboard-panel mt-4"><h3>Admin Password</h3><p class="muted">For security, change the initial password directly using a secure password-change workflow before production. Never use the development password on a live site.</p></div></div></div></section><?php require __DIR__.'/../includes/footer.php';?>
